repository-code: "https://github.com/D-sudoasd/2d-image-processor"
url: "https://github.com/D-sudoasd/2d-image-processor"
abstract: >-
  Desktop GUI software for batch preprocessing of 2D diffraction detector
  images, including SAXS, WAXS, SXRD, and GIWAXS workflows, with multi-format
  I/O, calibration, preview, geometry transforms, intensity processing, and
  Q conversion tools.
version: "6.0.0"
